    not_duplicate_of: []  # 0b66
    pr_ref:  # 0b66
    description: "yaml_ansible's find_ansible_files tags any root-level `.yml`/`.yaml` (or any file under roles/tasks/handlers/-named dirs) as `language=ansible` with NO content discrimination. In self-analysis the sole `ansible` node is `.yamllint.yaml` — a yamllint config, not a playbook — so metrics.languages.ansible={nodes:1} falsely reports Ansible content in a repo that has none. Fix: add a content discriminator (hosts:/tasks:/playbook structure) to find_ansible_files before tagging ansible. Surfaced via dogfooding; blinded severity 3/5."  # 0b66
    fields: {}  # 0b66
